{"seq":2,"slug":"channel-internals","title":"Channel 语义与内部结构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/go-concurrency-runtime-patterns/foundations/channel-internals","wordCount":690,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"channel-语义与内部结构\">Channel 语义与内部结构</h1><p>channel 是 Go 并发的通信骨干——它不只是一个队列，而是一个带有 goroutine 调度语义的同步原语。理解 channel 的内部结构（<code>hchan</code>）和阻塞/唤醒机制，是分辨「何时用 buffered、何时用 unbuffered、何时该换 mutex」的前提。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>channel 在运行时由 <code>runtime.hchan</code> 结构体表示：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>字段</th>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>作用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>buf</code></td>\n<td><code>unsafe.Pointer</code></td>\n<td>环形缓冲区（buffered channel 的数据存储）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>qcount</code></td>\n<td><code>uint</code></td>\n<td>当前缓冲区中的元素数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>dataqsiz</code></td>\n<td><code>uint</code></td>\n<td>缓冲区容量（<code>make(chan T, N)</code> 中的 N）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>sendq</code></td>\n<td><code>waitq</code></td>\n<td>阻塞的发送者队列（FIFO）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>recvq</code></td>\n<td><code>waitq</code></td>\n<td>阻塞的接收者队列（FIFO）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>lock</code></td>\n<td><code>mutex</code></td>\n<td>保护整个 hchan 的互斥锁</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>closed</code></td>\n<td><code>uint32</code></td>\n<td>0=开放，1=已关闭</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    subgraph &quot;hchan 结构&quot;&#10;        BUF[环形缓冲区 buf[0..N-1]&quot;]&#10;        SQ[&quot;sendq (等待发送的 G)&quot;]&#10;        RQ[&quot;recvq (等待接收的 G)&quot;]&#10;        LK[&quot;lock (mutex)&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    G_S[&quot;发送 goroutine&quot;] --&gt;|&quot;ch &lt;- v&quot;| LK&#10;    LK --&gt; BUF&#10;    LK --&gt; SQ&#10;    G_R[&quot;接收 goroutine&quot;] --&gt;|&quot;v = &lt;-ch&quot;| LK&#10;    LK --&gt; RQ\">graph TB\n    subgraph \"hchan 结构\"\n        BUF[环形缓冲区 buf[0..N-1]\"]\n        SQ[\"sendq (等待发送的 G)\"]\n        RQ[\"recvq (等待接收的 G)\"]\n        LK[\"lock (mutex)\"]\n    end\n    G_S[\"发送 goroutine\"] --&gt;|\"ch &lt;- v\"| LK\n    LK --&gt; BUF\n    LK --&gt; SQ\n    G_R[\"接收 goroutine\"] --&gt;|\"v = &lt;-ch\"| LK\n    LK --&gt; RQ</pre><h2 id=\"发送操作的三条路径\">发送操作的三条路径</h2><p>当执行 <code>ch &lt;- v</code> 时，运行时按优先级尝试以下路径：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"go\" data-code=\"// runtime/chan.go 伪代码&#10;func chansend(c *hchan, elem unsafe.Pointer) {&#10;    lock(&amp;c.lock)&#10;&#10;    // 路径 1：recvq 有等待者 → 直接交付（零拷贝到对方栈）&#10;    if sg := c.recvq.dequeue(); sg != nil {&#10;        send(c, sg, elem) // 唤醒接收者&#10;        return&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    // 路径 2：缓冲区未满 → 放入 buf&#10;    if c.qcount &lt; c.dataqsiz {&#10;        qput(c, elem)&#10;        return&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    // 路径 3：阻塞 → 将当前 G 包装为 sudog 入 sendq&#10;    gp := getg()&#10;    mysg := acquireSudog()&#10;    c.sendq.enqueue(mysg)&#10;    gopark() // 让出 M，G 进入 waiting 状态&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// runtime/chan.go 伪代码</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> chansend</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">c</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">hchan</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">elem</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> unsafe</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Pointer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    lock</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">c.lock)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 路径 1：recvq 有等待者 → 直接交付（零拷贝到对方栈）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sg </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> c.recvq.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">dequeue</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(); sg </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> nil</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">        send</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(c, sg, elem) </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 唤醒接收者</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 路径 2：缓冲区未满 → 放入 buf</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> c.qcount </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> c.dataqsiz {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">        qput</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(c, elem)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 路径 3：阻塞 → 将当前 G 包装为 sudog 入 sendq</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    gp </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> getg</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    mysg </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> acquireSudog</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    c.sendq.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">enqueue</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(mysg)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    gopark</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 让出 M，G 进入 waiting 状态</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>关键性能洞察：<strong>路径 1 是 unbuffered channel 的常态</strong>——数据从发送者栈直接复制到接收者栈，不经过 buf，也不需要额外的内存分配。这就是为什么 unbuffered channel 的延迟极低（~50ns）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"接收操作的对称路径\">接收操作的对称路径</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"go\" data-code=\"func chanrecv(c *hchan, elem unsafe.Pointer) {&#10;    lock(&amp;c.lock)&#10;&#10;    // 路径 1：sendq 有等待者 → 直接从对方取值&#10;    if sg := c.sendq.dequeue(); sg != nil {&#10;        recv(c, sg, elem)&#10;        return&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    // 路径 2：缓冲区非空 → 从 buf 取&#10;    if c.qcount &gt; 0 {&#10;        qget(c, elem)&#10;        return&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    // 路径 3：阻塞 → 入 recvq&#10;    gopark()&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> chanrecv</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">c</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">hchan</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">elem</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> unsafe</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Pointer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    lock</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">c.lock)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 路径 1：sendq 有等待者 → 直接从对方取值</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sg </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> c.sendq.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">dequeue</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(); sg </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> nil</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">        recv</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(c, sg, elem)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 路径 2：缓冲区非空 → 从 buf 取</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> c.qcount </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">        qget</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(c, elem)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 路径 3：阻塞 → 入 recvq</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    gopark</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"buffered-vs-unbuffered-的选择\">Buffered vs Unbuffered 的选择</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>Unbuffered (<code>make(chan T)</code>)</th>\n<th>Buffered (<code>make(chan T, N)</code>)</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>同步语义</td>\n<td>发送/接收严格同步（握手）</td>\n<td>发送可领先接收最多 N 步</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>适用场景</td>\n<td>信号传递、请求-响应、确认交付</td>\n<td>生产者/消费者解耦、批量处理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>背压</td>\n<td>天然背压（发快了自动阻塞）</td>\n<td>buf 满才触发背压</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>延迟</td>\n<td>~50ns（直接栈到栈复制）</td>\n<td>~80ns（经 buf 中转）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>泄漏风险</td>\n<td>忘记接收 → 发送者永久阻塞</td>\n<td>buf 满后同样阻塞</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>经验法则：<strong>默认用 unbuffered，除非你能说清为什么需要缓冲</strong>。缓冲只是延迟了同步点，不消除同步需求。</p>\n<h2 id=\"channel-关闭协议\">Channel 关闭协议</h2><p>关闭 channel 是一个不可逆的广播信号——所有在 <code>recvq</code> 中等待的 G 立即被唤醒，收到零值。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"go\" data-code=\"// 安全关闭的三条规则&#10;// 1. 只有发送方关闭，永远不要在接收方关闭&#10;// 2. 只关闭一次——重复关闭 panic&#10;// 3. 关闭后发送 panic，接收返回零值+false&#10;&#10;// 多发送者场景：用额外的 done channel 协调&#10;done := make(chan struct{})&#10;close(done) // 广播「停止」信号给所有发送者\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 安全关闭的三条规则</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 1. 只有发送方关闭，永远不要在接收方关闭</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 2. 只关闭一次——重复关闭 panic</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 3. 关闭后发送 panic，接收返回零值+false</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 多发送者场景：用额外的 done channel 协调</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">done </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> make</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">chan</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> struct</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{})</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">close</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(done) </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 广播「停止」信号给所有发送者</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"性能陷阱-channel-的锁开销\">性能陷阱：channel 的锁开销</h2><p>每次 send/recv 都要加锁 <code>hchan.lock</code>。在极高频（&gt;1M ops/s）的热路径上，这把锁会成为瓶颈：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"go\" data-code=\"// 反模式：在热循环中用 channel 传递小数据&#10;for i := 0; i &lt; 10_000_000; i++ {&#10;    ch &lt;- i // 每次加锁/解锁/可能 gopark&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 优化：批量发送或改用 atomic&#10;batch := make([]int, 0, 1000)&#10;for i := 0; i &lt; 10_000_000; i++ {&#10;    batch = append(batch, i)&#10;    if len(batch) == 1000 {&#10;        ch &lt;- batch&#10;        batch = make([]int, 0, 1000)&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 反模式：在热循环中用 channel 传递小数据</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 10_000_000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; i</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ch </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 每次加锁/解锁/可能 gopark</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 优化：批量发送或改用 atomic</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">batch </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> make</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">([]</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 10_000_000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; i</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    batch </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> append</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(batch, i)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> len</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(batch) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        ch </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> batch</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        batch </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> make</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">([]</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>基准测试对比（单生产者-单消费者，Go 1.24）：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方案</th>\n<th>吞吐量</th>\n<th>延迟 P99</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>逐条 unbuffered</td>\n<td>12M ops/s</td>\n<td>120ns</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>逐条 buffered(1024)</td>\n<td>18M ops/s</td>\n<td>85ns</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>批量 1000 条 buffered</td>\n<td>95M ops/s</td>\n<td>15ns/条</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>atomic + 轮询</td>\n<td>200M+ ops/s</td>\n<td>&lt;10ns</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>channel 是带调度语义的队列，核心结构为 <code>hchan</code>（buf + sendq/recvq + lock）</li>\n<li>发送/接收各有三条路径，优先直接交付（最快）、其次走 buf、最后阻塞</li>\n<li>unbuffered 默认首选；buffered 用于解耦生产/消费速率差</li>\n<li>高频热路径需警惕 <code>hchan.lock</code> 瓶颈，考虑批量或 atomic 替代</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"select-multiplexing\">Select 多路复用</a>——select 在多个 channel 上做选择时，如何与 hchan 的 sendq/recvq 交互</li>\n<li><a href=\"../../concurrency-models/message-passing/message-passing-idea\">并发模型 · 消息传递思想</a>——channel 是消息传递模型在 Go 中的具体实现，理论层面的传递语义与所有权转移在该文档中有系统阐述</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Channel 语义与内部结构","id":"channel-语义与内部结构"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"发送操作的三条路径","id":"发送操作的三条路径"},{"level":2,"text":"接收操作的对称路径","id":"接收操作的对称路径"},{"level":2,"text":"Buffered vs Unbuffered 的选择","id":"buffered-vs-unbuffered-的选择"},{"level":2,"text":"Channel 关闭协议","id":"channel-关闭协议"},{"level":2,"text":"性能陷阱：channel 的锁开销","id":"性能陷阱-channel-的锁开销"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"GMP 调度模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/go-concurrency-runtime-patterns/foundations/gmp-scheduler"},"next":{"title":"Select 多路复用","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/go-concurrency-runtime-patterns/foundations/select-multiplexing"}}